WEBVTT

01:55.680 --> 01:58.320
Why are you messing with Tang Qi again?

01:59.040 --> 02:01.880
Why are you blaming me?

02:01.960 --> 02:04.360
It was Tang Qi who messed with me.

02:04.440 --> 02:06.880
How could I know he'd hide
in Guan Shengyu's office?

02:11.160 --> 02:14.440
Thousand Birds Collection wants
the patent of Air Fiber Elastic Mesh.

02:16.480 --> 02:20.240
Surprisingly, Fang Jin was the one
who developed Elastic Mesh No. 3.

02:21.480 --> 02:22.880
You didn't let them find out, right?

02:28.320 --> 02:29.160
No.

02:31.200 --> 02:32.560
To be honest.

02:42.400 --> 02:44.880
I thought no one was there,

02:45.600 --> 02:49.000
and I couldn't help but beat that scum up.

02:49.080 --> 02:51.360
You have no idea how disgusting he was.

02:52.480 --> 02:54.120
Do you mean

02:54.200 --> 02:56.240
Tang Qi is the eyewitness

02:56.320 --> 02:58.800
of Fang Jin's domestic violence
against Guan Shengyu?

02:59.880 --> 03:01.040
Sister…

03:01.880 --> 03:03.160
I promise I'll deal with Tang Qi.

03:03.240 --> 03:04.160
I won't let him talk nonsense.

03:04.240 --> 03:06.760
How? Break his legs?

03:11.760 --> 03:15.640
Sorry, I was too impulsive.

03:19.240 --> 03:20.600
I'm also responsible.

03:20.680 --> 03:22.040
I didn't get enough information.

03:24.240 --> 03:26.360
You only need to keep an eye on Tang Qi

03:26.440 --> 03:28.280
and stop Thousand Birds Collection

03:28.360 --> 03:29.440
from signing a deal with

03:29.520 --> 03:31.120
Xinnan Technology
before Fang Jin wakes up.

03:31.200 --> 03:32.960
I'll take care of the rest.

03:33.040 --> 03:36.000
Okay, I'll keep an eye on him.

03:38.920 --> 03:41.840
I thought you told white lies
just like I did.

03:42.960 --> 03:44.680
Sorry, I really have something to do.

03:44.760 --> 03:45.880
My friend will treat me.

03:50.040 --> 03:51.240
Sir, this way, please.

04:05.200 --> 04:06.080
Okay, thanks.

04:11.760 --> 04:12.680
Thanks.

04:22.880 --> 04:24.160
Your birthday?

04:24.240 --> 04:25.080
No.

04:25.840 --> 04:26.720
You won the lottery?

04:27.320 --> 04:28.160
No.

04:29.800 --> 04:31.240
Then, what's all this about?

04:31.320 --> 04:32.720
I thought it was a regular meal.

04:34.000 --> 04:35.480
I suddenly wanted

04:35.560 --> 04:38.560
to try the dining style
of a domineering boss.

04:40.760 --> 04:44.720
Do bosses in the comics
have meals like this?

04:46.600 --> 04:49.320
In girls' comics and idol dramas.

04:52.160 --> 04:55.520
Did I react in the wrong way?

04:55.600 --> 04:57.400
No, you did well.

04:58.160 --> 05:01.440
Nowadays, such plot twists
are quite popular.

05:01.520 --> 05:03.600
A heroine with such a reaction

05:04.680 --> 05:06.120
is quite funny.

05:06.720 --> 05:07.760
Heroine?

05:13.440 --> 05:14.960
Are you the domineering boss?

05:16.960 --> 05:17.800
Do I look like it?

05:21.040 --> 05:24.160
A rich and successful young woman,

05:24.240 --> 05:26.200
you are a domineering boss.

05:27.560 --> 05:29.960
All the editors liked
my new comic outline, saying

05:30.040 --> 05:31.840
I made a breakthrough. Thank you.

05:33.080 --> 05:34.360
I'm just saying that.

05:34.440 --> 05:35.720
It was all because
of your brilliant ideas.

05:42.960 --> 05:45.360
As a volunteer
of Animal Protection Association,

05:45.440 --> 05:47.440
you must know a lot about animals.

05:49.120 --> 05:51.560
I've liked reading
these books since I was little.

05:51.640 --> 05:53.400
I know more than ordinary people do,

05:53.480 --> 05:55.040
but I'm not an expert.

05:55.120 --> 05:57.720
I want to create comics

05:57.800 --> 05:59.640
based on common animals
in our daily lives,

05:59.720 --> 06:01.160
such as white geese and silver carp.

06:01.240 --> 06:04.080
I wonder if you can take me
to your activities,

06:04.160 --> 06:05.840
so that I can know more about animals.

06:06.560 --> 06:09.440
Of course. What is the story about?

06:12.080 --> 06:14.480
After her parents divorced, remarried,

06:14.560 --> 06:16.160
and abandoned her,

06:16.240 --> 06:18.640
the heroine felt isolated and insecure

06:18.720 --> 06:21.000
and lived cautiously
and anxiously all the time.

06:21.520 --> 06:22.520
After her grandpa's death,

06:22.600 --> 06:25.560
she inherited a poor-managed farm

06:25.640 --> 06:28.440
with white geese, silver carp,

06:28.520 --> 06:30.200
and other animals…

06:52.200 --> 06:55.800
Guan Shengyu wanted to sell
the patent as soon as possible,

06:55.880 --> 06:57.480
but Fang Jin wouldn't agree.

06:58.560 --> 07:01.200
It's their family affair.

07:01.280 --> 07:04.680
Maybe we should go with another plan.

07:05.920 --> 07:06.840
You have a point.

07:09.880 --> 07:12.920
Elastic Mesh No. 3 is the best choice.

07:13.000 --> 07:14.480
What's the second-best choice?

07:14.560 --> 07:17.920
There is no second-best choice
for customers.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.120
Only the best one.

07:27.200 --> 07:30.000
Guan Shengyu is the legal person
of Xinnan Technology

07:30.080 --> 07:31.760
and has the right to sell the patent.

07:31.840 --> 07:34.080
Legally speaking,

07:34.160 --> 07:35.960
we don't need to care what Fang Jin wants.

07:37.040 --> 07:38.200
Even if they get a divorce,

07:38.280 --> 07:41.560
it's between them
and none of our business.

07:42.960 --> 07:45.600
That's right. If we sign the deal quickly,

07:45.680 --> 07:48.360
their divorce won't affect us.

07:48.440 --> 07:49.960
But isn't that a bit inappropriate?

07:50.040 --> 07:52.120
Dr. Fang Jin has been staying in the lab.

07:52.200 --> 07:54.000
She can't beat the cunning Guan Shengyu.

07:54.760 --> 07:56.680
She worked hard on the product, but she

07:56.760 --> 07:57.680
can't make the decision.

07:57.760 --> 08:00.440
Guan Shengyu took it away from her.

08:01.960 --> 08:03.920
But this is business.

08:04.000 --> 08:05.720
Even if we don't buy it,

08:05.800 --> 08:08.360
Guan Shengyu will sell it to others.

08:09.800 --> 08:11.240
Our rivals.

08:11.320 --> 08:14.520
Yes. Our rivals will buy it.

08:19.760 --> 08:20.760
Come in.

08:25.520 --> 08:26.520
Mr. Tang,

08:26.600 --> 08:28.680
Mr. Guan from Xinnan Technology
wants to see you.

08:28.760 --> 08:30.080
He's in the meeting room.

08:34.400 --> 08:37.159
What is he up to?

08:38.480 --> 08:41.440
He's so eager. Isn't he afraid
we'll drive a hard bargain?

08:42.320 --> 08:44.760
There must be something wrong.

08:45.640 --> 08:46.800
I need to see him.

08:57.000 --> 08:59.640
Tang is a moral person.
It can't be that simple.

09:00.520 --> 09:03.280
Just in case,
you should prepare a backup plan.

09:04.160 --> 09:05.000
I will.

09:05.600 --> 09:08.600
It was supposed to be a family matter,

09:09.200 --> 09:10.120
but…

09:12.520 --> 09:13.720
As you can see,

09:14.440 --> 09:17.040
Fang Jin and I
don't love each other anymore

09:17.120 --> 09:18.360
and want to divorce.

09:18.440 --> 09:21.960
Fang Jin is selfish and capricious.

09:22.040 --> 09:23.800
She can't see the bigger picture.

09:23.880 --> 09:26.800
So, Mr. Tang, I want you
to testify against

09:27.560 --> 09:29.120
Fang Jin's domestic violence.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.440
As for the patent,

09:34.520 --> 09:36.320
you want it, and I will sell it.

09:36.400 --> 09:37.560
We have the same goal.

09:38.240 --> 09:40.000
If you can help me,

09:40.080 --> 09:42.080
I'll offer you a great price

09:42.160 --> 09:43.680
and sign the deal immediately.

09:54.880 --> 09:56.320
Good morning, Mr. Tang.

09:56.400 --> 09:57.360
What's wrong?

09:59.120 --> 10:01.200
Nothing. Just passing by.

10:01.280 --> 10:02.360
Passing by.

10:14.240 --> 10:17.320
I chose the wrong way. Just passing by.

10:37.360 --> 10:38.920
If you can help me,

10:39.000 --> 10:41.080
I'll offer you a great price

10:41.160 --> 10:42.560
and sign the deal immediately.

10:43.080 --> 10:44.720
Will Tang Qi make a deal
with Guan Shengyu?

11:15.560 --> 11:17.800
Dr. Tang, hello. I'm Fang Jin.

11:17.880 --> 11:20.560
You said you wanted
to talk to me in person.

11:20.640 --> 11:22.520
When do you have time?

11:25.440 --> 11:26.520
I'm free now.

11:39.840 --> 11:42.160
Sorry! Sorry!

11:42.240 --> 11:44.480
I didn't get scalded.

11:44.560 --> 11:45.520
It's okay.

11:45.600 --> 11:47.840
It's just stained. Don't worry.

11:47.920 --> 11:50.720
How much should I pay?

11:50.800 --> 11:52.480
No need.

11:52.560 --> 11:55.200
I bought this sweater on Pinduoduo.

11:55.280 --> 11:56.360
It's cheap.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.880
Look, there's a thread.

12:13.200 --> 12:16.520
Why is it sturdy in the wrong spot?

12:16.600 --> 12:18.520
- I'll get scissors.
- Okay.

12:18.600 --> 12:20.720
When you pull a thread from a sweater,
it'll only get longer.

12:20.800 --> 12:21.800
You have to cut it.

12:21.880 --> 12:22.840
Okay, thanks.

12:33.920 --> 12:35.040
Dr. Fang.

12:38.120 --> 12:39.600
Hello, Dr. Tang.

12:39.680 --> 12:40.800
Hello.

12:40.880 --> 12:42.680
- Have a seat.
- You too.

12:47.400 --> 12:48.480
Sorry about that.

12:48.560 --> 12:50.400
It's okay. Let me help you.

12:52.440 --> 12:53.480
No…

12:54.640 --> 12:55.760
I…

12:57.080 --> 12:58.480
- This way.
- Which way?

12:58.560 --> 12:59.480
This way.

13:02.000 --> 13:03.080
Don't move.

13:06.360 --> 13:07.360
I'll untie you.

13:18.360 --> 13:20.840
Miss, let me help you cut the thread.

13:20.920 --> 13:21.760
Okay, here.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.640
Cut it right here.

13:25.720 --> 13:27.080
- And this spot.
- Okay.

13:27.160 --> 13:28.520
Thanks.

14:28.800 --> 14:29.920
Lift your foot.

14:32.520 --> 14:33.760
Your sleeve…

14:36.280 --> 14:37.360
That's asymmetrical beauty.

14:40.920 --> 14:42.320
Sir, what would you like?

14:44.720 --> 14:45.600
Same as hers.

14:45.680 --> 14:46.920
Okay.

14:48.720 --> 14:49.840
Have a seat.

14:49.920 --> 14:50.760
Here.

15:00.560 --> 15:02.640
Dr. Fang, I…

15:34.720 --> 15:37.640
Sorry, I got this on you.

15:40.400 --> 15:41.520
Thanks.

15:41.600 --> 15:42.560
You're welcome.

15:59.160 --> 16:02.320
About Air Fiber Elastic Mesh…

16:05.800 --> 16:07.600
Read this material first.

16:14.720 --> 16:15.560
Fang Jin…

16:18.080 --> 16:20.520
I trust Guan Shengyu

16:20.600 --> 16:21.960
and only care about my research,

16:22.040 --> 16:24.680
so he's been managing the company.

16:24.760 --> 16:26.520
Over the years, I've lived a simple life.

16:26.600 --> 16:28.440
I wouldn't even buy a fancy sweater.

16:28.520 --> 16:31.200
And my parents are still living
in an old house.

16:31.280 --> 16:33.080
However, Guan Shengyu has been

16:33.160 --> 16:35.080
playing around
and spending money extravagantly.

16:39.920 --> 16:41.360
Did he beat you?

16:41.440 --> 16:42.520
Yes.

16:42.600 --> 16:45.680
If you help him, you'll be his accomplice.

16:53.720 --> 16:54.600
Thanks.

16:56.440 --> 16:58.480
It's on the house.

17:00.000 --> 17:01.240
Thanks.

17:04.160 --> 17:05.400
Apple is my favorite fruit.

17:30.160 --> 17:33.560
The discussion and purchase
of the patent of Air Fiber Elastic Mesh

17:33.640 --> 17:35.040
are up to our company.

17:35.560 --> 17:36.880
I can't decide it.

17:37.640 --> 17:40.040
I'm here to ask you something.

17:40.120 --> 17:41.200
I…

17:43.840 --> 17:45.600
I'm sure you can do me a favor.

17:45.680 --> 17:46.960
What?

17:50.680 --> 17:55.000
I hit Guan Shengyu in the meeting room.

17:55.080 --> 17:57.280
Can you keep the secret?

18:01.280 --> 18:02.200
Fang Jin…

18:03.520 --> 18:06.720
I look serious and cool,

18:06.800 --> 18:09.640
but in fact, I'm kind and simple.

18:09.720 --> 18:12.840
I don't even know how to argue.
How could I hit someone?

18:15.800 --> 18:18.000
That wasn't me.

18:18.080 --> 18:20.320
I mean it. I was possessed by a ghost.

18:21.680 --> 18:23.400
I'm not that kind of person.

18:27.040 --> 18:30.280
Sorry, I can't help you.

18:30.880 --> 18:32.000
Why?

18:32.080 --> 18:34.320
You know he's a scum,

18:34.400 --> 18:35.960
so why are you testifying for him?

18:36.040 --> 18:37.000
Dr. Fang,

18:37.080 --> 18:40.840
as a researcher, no matter what happens,

18:40.920 --> 18:42.160
I should respect the fact

18:42.760 --> 18:45.080
and state the facts objectively.

18:49.480 --> 18:50.360
GUAN SHENGYU

18:55.560 --> 18:56.440
Sorry.

18:59.920 --> 19:00.760
I…

19:10.160 --> 19:12.920
We're experienced in elastic mesh R&D

19:13.000 --> 19:14.720
and can make any product you want.

19:14.800 --> 19:18.040
We'll fulfill all your needs.

19:21.240 --> 19:22.440
What's the material?

19:22.520 --> 19:23.800
It's thin and feels nice.

19:24.800 --> 19:27.280
Nylon spandex is also
a kind of fiber membrane.

19:27.360 --> 19:29.760
It's the ultra-thin material
we've recently developed.

19:29.840 --> 19:32.280
It's softer, with good skin adhesion.

19:32.360 --> 19:35.960
It can absorb more oil than
polyester spandex but rebound slowly.

19:36.040 --> 19:38.680
The foundation absorption rate
is lower than the previous version.

19:41.240 --> 19:42.080
And the multi-layered version?

19:42.800 --> 19:45.160
This is our flagship product.

19:45.240 --> 19:48.440
We used multi-layered nylon spandex

19:48.520 --> 19:50.200
to deal with the slow rebound,

19:50.280 --> 19:53.560
but it's thicker.

19:55.080 --> 19:57.240
I'll urge the company to make a decision.

19:57.320 --> 19:59.640
No problem. I'll be waiting.

19:59.720 --> 20:02.240
Whether you choose
our independently developed products

20:02.320 --> 20:04.200
or entrust us with
the production of elastic mesh,

20:04.280 --> 20:07.440
we'll ensure the quality
and follow your time arrangements.

20:07.520 --> 20:09.720
- Mr. Zhang, thanks for your support.
- My pleasure.

20:10.840 --> 20:12.320
Mr. Zhang, thank you so much.

20:12.400 --> 20:15.240
If you need anything, feel free to ask me.

20:16.240 --> 20:18.000
I do have a favor to ask.

20:22.200 --> 20:25.080
BEAUTIFUL COMIC ARTIST, LIN QIAQIA

20:25.160 --> 20:27.760
Is this Lin Yuan's interview?

20:27.840 --> 20:29.080
I didn't expect

20:29.160 --> 20:31.400
my daughter to be a big fan of Ms. Lin.

20:31.480 --> 20:33.600
She decided to learn to draw after reading

20:33.680 --> 20:34.720
Ms. Lin's comic books.

20:34.800 --> 20:37.960
She's been rebellious

20:38.040 --> 20:39.560
and angry with me.

20:39.640 --> 20:43.000
I want to ask for Ms. Lin's autograph
and surprise her.

20:43.880 --> 20:44.960
Okay, no problem.

20:49.640 --> 20:51.960
I want to ask Ms. Lin to sign these books

20:52.040 --> 20:53.880
to encourage my daughter.

20:53.960 --> 20:56.360
Is it too much trouble?

20:56.920 --> 20:59.680
Not at all.
I'm sure Lin Yuan will be glad to know

20:59.760 --> 21:01.480
she has such a loyal fan.

21:15.280 --> 21:17.520
My daughter has cherished them

21:17.600 --> 21:19.840
and read them many times.

21:19.920 --> 21:22.520
They're important to her. Thanks.

21:23.400 --> 21:25.680
You're welcome. Put them in the trunk.

21:25.760 --> 21:26.800
Okay.

21:32.240 --> 21:33.600
By the way,

21:35.000 --> 21:37.680
this is my daughter's name.

21:37.760 --> 21:40.120
It'd be better if she could
write her name on them.

21:43.040 --> 21:44.600
TO FANFAN

21:48.560 --> 21:50.240
Sure, no problem.

21:50.320 --> 21:51.240
Thanks.

21:55.120 --> 21:57.120
SOUL DETECTIVE

21:57.200 --> 21:58.960
That's a lot!

22:00.280 --> 22:02.040
I know it's a lot.

22:02.120 --> 22:04.600
Do I have to sign every book?

22:06.760 --> 22:08.320
Yeah.

22:08.400 --> 22:11.960
By the way, can you please
write her name on them?

22:12.960 --> 22:14.800
Mr. Zhang's wife
passed away a few years ago,

22:14.880 --> 22:17.560
and his daughter is rebellious
and can't get along with him.

22:18.160 --> 22:19.880
They had a big fight the other day.

22:20.480 --> 22:23.320
Mr. Zhang is doing all this
to make her happy.

22:25.560 --> 22:26.680
Fanfan.

22:27.320 --> 22:29.360
Do I need to write her name on every book?

22:30.200 --> 22:32.680
I counted it. It's 17 strokes in total.

22:32.760 --> 22:35.000
You can write one character, Fan.

22:35.680 --> 22:36.520
It's more friendly.

22:37.120 --> 22:38.760
And you can write fewer strokes.

22:41.280 --> 22:42.160
That's really a lot.

22:47.440 --> 22:48.600
Here's the thing.

22:48.680 --> 22:51.040
Mr. Zhang's factory has 20 years
of production experience.

22:51.720 --> 22:54.560
He produces materials
for many makeup brands.

22:54.640 --> 22:55.960
We're just a start-up company,

22:56.040 --> 22:58.800
and he agreed because of our connections.

22:58.880 --> 23:01.200
We can even choose
from two elastic mesh products.

23:02.920 --> 23:03.760
Of course,

23:05.440 --> 23:08.640
this is my fault.

23:08.720 --> 23:11.240
I used your connection for myself.

23:11.320 --> 23:12.320
I'm sorry.

23:13.520 --> 23:17.440
When we ate together,
you said everything was going well.

23:17.520 --> 23:18.560
It turns out that

23:19.920 --> 23:21.200
the hard part was yet to come.

23:28.240 --> 23:31.680
Fanfan is loved.

23:36.520 --> 23:40.080
Her father really loves her.

23:53.240 --> 23:55.200
This is the earliest edition.

23:55.280 --> 23:56.280
My first published work.

23:56.960 --> 23:59.600
I didn't expect someone would cherish it.

24:01.920 --> 24:05.520
These books prove
that she really likes me.

24:05.600 --> 24:07.240
I'm really glad.

24:07.320 --> 24:08.480
Why would it be the hard part?

24:09.080 --> 24:11.520
Don't worry. I'll sign all of them

24:11.600 --> 24:13.560
and give Fanfan a big surprise.

24:18.640 --> 24:20.000
Thank you.

24:21.320 --> 24:23.400
Friends are supposed to use each other.

24:23.480 --> 24:25.840
You need to help me with my new work.

24:27.720 --> 24:29.840
I'll tell you anything I know.

24:58.080 --> 25:01.120
They made statements
in the police station.

25:01.200 --> 25:02.480
It's not good for us.

25:10.920 --> 25:12.440
I'll go there.

25:12.520 --> 25:15.880
Stay calm and keep an eye on the patent.

25:19.720 --> 25:20.560
What's wrong?

25:22.080 --> 25:23.600
Mr. Tang,

25:23.680 --> 25:26.840
has our company got
the patent of Elastic Mesh No. 3?

25:28.520 --> 25:29.600
Who told you that?

25:30.680 --> 25:32.960
You did a big favor for Guan Shengyu.

25:34.200 --> 25:36.640
Will you sign the deal soon?

25:45.040 --> 25:49.840
Is your sister Fang Jin's lawyer?

25:51.920 --> 25:53.200
Yes.

25:53.280 --> 25:55.240
You two were classmates.

25:55.320 --> 25:57.800
So, can you tell me
when you will sign the deal?

26:01.520 --> 26:02.400
Ask your sister.

26:07.520 --> 26:09.080
Ask my sister?

26:28.120 --> 26:31.800
Tang Qi told the police
that Fang Jin hit him first.

26:32.760 --> 26:33.720
Yes.

26:34.600 --> 26:35.840
I didn't do anything.

26:35.920 --> 26:37.840
She hit me.

26:37.920 --> 26:39.720
Mr. Tang can testify.

26:39.800 --> 26:41.840
Is he telling the truth?

26:41.920 --> 26:42.920
Yes.

26:43.000 --> 26:45.560
I saw Fang Jin hit Guan Shengyu first.

26:45.640 --> 26:48.120
Well, Officer, I'm telling the truth.

26:49.240 --> 26:51.960
Before she hit him,
I heard Guan Shengyu tell her,

26:52.040 --> 26:53.680
"You're as boring as wood.

26:53.760 --> 26:54.960
How could I not cheat on you?"

26:55.040 --> 26:57.120
Wait, wait. No need for this.

26:58.400 --> 26:59.640
It doesn't matter.

26:59.720 --> 27:01.680
He also told her,

27:01.760 --> 27:02.920
"There's no surveillance.

27:03.000 --> 27:04.680
- I can hit you as I want."
- Wait…

27:04.760 --> 27:06.160
- He also threatened her to behave,
- Enough.

27:06.240 --> 27:07.600
- or he wouldn't
- Mr. Tang.

27:07.680 --> 27:08.520
give her anything.

27:08.600 --> 27:10.200
Tang Qi! Are you crazy?

27:10.280 --> 27:12.520
Silence! Sit down!

27:23.400 --> 27:25.560
I promised you to tell the truth.

27:28.040 --> 27:30.360
When Guan Shengyu
just got a little carried away,

27:30.440 --> 27:32.240
Tang Qi testified

27:32.320 --> 27:34.360
that Guan Shengyu admitted

27:34.440 --> 27:36.000
he beat and cheated on Fang Jin

27:36.080 --> 27:37.560
and transferred joint marital assets,

27:37.640 --> 27:39.720
and Fang Jin lost control
and hit Fang Jin.

27:39.800 --> 27:41.160
Yes.

27:41.240 --> 27:43.280
This testimony is beneficial to Fang Jin.

27:43.360 --> 27:47.280
I knew Tang Qi wouldn't help that scum.

27:51.840 --> 27:53.720
Tang Qi is indeed a good man.

27:53.800 --> 27:57.200
He's smart, capable, and righteous.

27:57.800 --> 28:00.600
Indeed. He looks serious,

28:01.240 --> 28:04.200
yet he managed to set up
that cunning Guan Shengyu.

28:07.800 --> 28:10.880
Su Chengcheng, are you having
a crush on Tang Qi again?

28:11.760 --> 28:13.920
How's that possible?

28:14.000 --> 28:15.880
I'm just telling the truth.

28:17.160 --> 28:18.320
Good.

28:19.120 --> 28:21.280
Guan Shengyu is mad at Tang Qi,

28:21.360 --> 28:23.480
so he won't sell the patent to him.

28:24.720 --> 28:26.120
Keep your distance from Tang Qi.

28:26.800 --> 28:29.160
Don't make trouble again.

28:51.800 --> 28:52.840
Don't worry.

28:52.920 --> 28:55.320
Now that Guan Shengyu has turned us down,

28:56.440 --> 28:58.400
let's go with the backup plan.

28:58.480 --> 29:00.000
Let's use Elastic Mesh No. 5.

29:00.080 --> 29:01.880
As long as he doesn't sign a deal,

29:01.960 --> 29:03.160
we still have a chance.

29:03.240 --> 29:05.520
Give me some time. I want to try.

29:05.600 --> 29:07.720
How? What should we do?

29:07.800 --> 29:08.640
It's not an experiment.

29:08.720 --> 29:11.320
Even if we stick it out,
we might still fail.

29:11.920 --> 29:13.160
Say something.

29:20.800 --> 29:21.920
We still have a chance.

29:25.680 --> 29:27.680
If Fang Jin wins the case

29:27.760 --> 29:30.000
and get the disposal rights,

29:30.080 --> 29:32.680
we can get the patent from Fang Jin.

29:38.840 --> 29:39.680
Good.

29:41.920 --> 29:43.240
Great.

29:52.080 --> 29:54.360
Let's prepare both plans

29:56.320 --> 29:57.560
before Guan Shengyu signs a deal.

30:07.600 --> 30:08.520
Thanks.

30:08.600 --> 30:10.280
- What would you like for lunch?
- Whatever.

30:10.360 --> 30:11.440
Same old place?

30:11.520 --> 30:12.760
- Okay.
- Okay.

30:17.920 --> 30:20.960
I heard Mr. Guan from Xinnan Technology
is mad at Mr. Tang.

30:21.640 --> 30:23.200
We can't get the patent
of Elastic Mesh No. 3.

30:23.280 --> 30:24.560
We'll use No. 5.

30:24.640 --> 30:27.160
Why is Mr. Guan angry?

30:27.240 --> 30:30.240
It seems Mr. Tang offended him.

30:36.280 --> 30:38.000
Due to some uncertainties,

30:38.080 --> 30:40.200
we have to prepare two plans.

30:40.800 --> 30:42.600
Wang Yi, you're in charge
of Elastic Mesh No. 5.

30:42.680 --> 30:44.120
Xu Yue, deal with No. 3.

30:45.400 --> 30:46.440
Thank you.

30:48.360 --> 30:49.520
I want to prepare Elastic Mesh No. 5.

30:55.840 --> 30:58.720
I prefer the texture of No. 5.

30:58.800 --> 31:00.680
I can make a more creative plan.

31:06.160 --> 31:08.280
Okay, I'll be in charge of No. 3.

31:09.160 --> 31:10.360
Then, it's a deal.

31:10.440 --> 31:12.720
No matter which plan we choose,

31:12.800 --> 31:14.280
the other group will get
the same amount of bonus.

31:15.120 --> 31:18.200
Wang Yi, Xu Yue,
you can choose your team members.

31:20.720 --> 31:21.560
Get back to work.

31:24.280 --> 31:26.520
- Can I join you?
- Okay.

31:26.600 --> 31:28.160
Xu Yue, pick me.

31:28.240 --> 31:29.360
- Yue.
- I'll buy you coffee.

31:29.440 --> 31:30.560
- I said it first.
- Yue, Yue.

31:30.640 --> 31:31.920
- I'll buy you two cups of coffee, okay?
- I…

31:32.000 --> 31:33.200
I said it first.

31:33.280 --> 31:34.240
Don't compete with me.

31:34.320 --> 31:35.520
Stop doing this!

31:35.600 --> 31:36.880
I said it first.

31:42.480 --> 31:45.960
It seems they haven't given up
on Fang Jin's patent.

31:51.800 --> 31:52.800
Yi.

31:54.560 --> 31:56.200
I want to join your team.

31:58.000 --> 32:00.200
I'll definitely do my best.

32:00.280 --> 32:01.800
I can work overtime.

32:06.000 --> 32:07.600
Welcome.

32:09.680 --> 32:11.320
- Let's talk about it later.
- Okay.

32:32.240 --> 32:33.120
Hello, Chengcheng.

32:33.200 --> 32:34.560
What's the matter?

32:34.640 --> 32:35.720
Tang Qi called Fang Jin

32:35.800 --> 32:37.440
but couldn't get through.
He called me instead.

32:37.520 --> 32:39.040
Tang Qi?

32:40.720 --> 32:42.560
Why did he call Fang Jin?

32:43.160 --> 32:45.720
He wanted to visit her lab,

32:46.240 --> 32:47.480
and I agreed.

32:48.080 --> 32:48.960
What?

32:49.040 --> 32:52.440
You often say
one should be grateful, right?

32:52.520 --> 32:53.960
Tang Qi did me a big favor,

32:54.040 --> 32:57.000
so I can't reject this small thing.

32:57.080 --> 32:58.680
Who told me to keep my distance from him

32:58.760 --> 33:00.320
and stop making trouble?

33:00.400 --> 33:03.480
I did tell you to keep your distance,

33:03.560 --> 33:05.800
but it doesn't mean
Fang Jin should keep her distance.

33:05.880 --> 33:07.840
Su Qingli, this is ridiculous.

33:07.920 --> 33:09.480
Then ask Fang Jin to meet Tang Qi.

33:09.560 --> 33:11.640
I have to work. Goodbye.

33:11.720 --> 33:12.720
Chengcheng, Chengcheng.

33:12.800 --> 33:16.200
If Fang Jin really wants to sell
the patent of Air Fiber Elastic Mesh,

33:16.280 --> 33:18.160
Tang Qi will be the best choice.

33:19.040 --> 33:22.360
For the sake of Fang Jin,
please do me a favor.

33:25.200 --> 33:26.680
What do I need to do?

33:26.760 --> 33:29.360
Contact Tang Qi in the name of Fang Jin

33:29.440 --> 33:30.480
and meet him tomorrow night.

33:30.560 --> 33:32.840
It won't affect your work.

33:42.560 --> 33:44.720
SIM CARD MANAGEMENT

34:06.040 --> 34:07.600
Hello, Dr. Fang.

34:07.680 --> 34:08.719
Hello…

34:10.440 --> 34:11.440
Hello?

34:12.840 --> 34:13.880
Hello?

34:17.080 --> 34:17.920
Dr. Fang?

34:18.000 --> 34:19.120
Hello?

34:21.639 --> 34:22.400
MR. TANG, TBC

34:22.480 --> 34:23.440
Fang…

34:35.320 --> 34:36.400
MR. TANG, TBC

34:37.760 --> 34:39.280
Is not answered for the moment…

34:46.480 --> 34:49.080
Sorry, I have an emergency

34:49.159 --> 34:51.199
and can't talk on the phone.

34:51.280 --> 34:53.840
Su Qingli told me about it. Thanks.

34:53.920 --> 34:56.080
See you tomorrow at 7 p.m.

34:58.920 --> 35:00.360
Is everything okay?

35:00.920 --> 35:03.080
I think I heard a fire alarm.

35:04.520 --> 35:06.400
It's okay. It's somewhere else.

35:06.480 --> 35:08.360
The fire truck just passed by.

35:09.840 --> 35:10.760
What a coincidence.

35:11.640 --> 35:14.200
A fire truck also passed by over here.

35:14.280 --> 35:17.200
Of course, it's the same fire truck.

35:19.520 --> 35:21.680
I have to work. See you tomorrow.

35:23.160 --> 35:25.480
Okay, see you tomorrow.

35:38.440 --> 35:42.000
XINNAN TECHNOLOGY
AIR FIBER ELASTIC MESH INDICATORS

35:58.400 --> 36:00.160
ANGRY SISTER

36:00.240 --> 36:02.640
Are you really my sister?

36:06.680 --> 36:10.320
You don't need to understand it.
Just memorize it.

36:12.680 --> 36:14.000
If I could memorize knowledge,

36:14.080 --> 36:16.960
I wouldn't have had to use
sports to get into college.

36:21.800 --> 36:23.600
It'll affect Fang Jin's future.

36:23.680 --> 36:26.440
Don't be exposed. You can do it.

36:34.200 --> 36:36.320
XINNAN TECHNOLOGY FIBER SYNTHESIS RESEARCH

36:40.760 --> 36:41.600
Mr. Tang.

36:41.680 --> 36:42.520
Hello.

36:46.560 --> 36:49.280
FIBER SYNTHESIS FORMULA

37:03.240 --> 37:04.080
Are you in Wang Yi's team?

37:05.680 --> 37:06.840
Yes.

37:08.400 --> 37:12.840
I'm studying air fiber for the proposal.

37:12.920 --> 37:15.800
I want to express it more accurately
by understanding the process.

37:18.320 --> 37:19.280
You're so hard-working.

37:19.360 --> 37:21.520
Not at all. I'm just doing my job.

37:26.240 --> 37:27.360
Tomorrow at 7 p.m.,

37:27.440 --> 37:29.840
Mr. Tang will visit Dr. Fang Jin
from Xinnan Technology

37:29.920 --> 37:31.480
and need an assistant.

37:32.240 --> 37:33.480
Maybe…

37:33.560 --> 37:36.040
Su Chengcheng will visit her with me.

37:40.000 --> 37:41.960
Su Chengcheng, is there a problem?

37:45.720 --> 37:47.040
No problem.

37:47.120 --> 37:50.360
When she joined my team,
she said she could work overtime.

37:52.320 --> 37:53.240
She's so hard-working.

37:55.520 --> 37:56.760
Then it's a deal.

38:01.960 --> 38:03.240
Do your best.

38:04.240 --> 38:05.200
Thanks.

38:07.360 --> 38:10.360
Do my best?

38:10.440 --> 38:11.440
This is…

38:11.520 --> 38:12.720
ridiculous.

38:51.480 --> 38:54.680
Su Chengcheng meets Fang Jin.

38:54.760 --> 38:56.880
I can only transform
instead of creating someone else.

38:56.960 --> 38:59.240
How can I create another person
to meet myself?

38:59.880 --> 39:03.080
Don't worry. We're here.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.680
Sister, what should I do?

39:07.440 --> 39:09.720
Why can't they find another person
to accompany Tang Qi?

39:10.480 --> 39:11.720
They can.

39:11.800 --> 39:14.040
I'll turn him down, offend my leaders,

39:14.120 --> 39:15.680
and become the joke of the company,

39:15.760 --> 39:17.920
and my career will be destroyed again.

39:18.000 --> 39:19.600
Absolutely not.

39:19.680 --> 39:21.240
We can help Fang Jin,

39:21.320 --> 39:23.000
but we can't sacrifice
Chengcheng's career.

39:26.120 --> 39:29.280
Then we have to fake it until we make it.

39:32.880 --> 39:36.200
Sister, I remember Tang Qi's grades

39:36.280 --> 39:38.800
were better than yours.

39:38.880 --> 39:42.720
I think he's smarter than you.

39:42.800 --> 39:44.240
Are you sure you can fool him?

39:46.680 --> 39:48.880
Su Chengcheng, you're really…

39:50.920 --> 39:52.080
Tang Qi.

39:55.520 --> 39:56.960
Hello, Mr. Tang.

39:57.040 --> 39:58.080
Have you arrived?

39:58.160 --> 40:00.280
I'm at the door of Dr. Fang's lab.

40:00.360 --> 40:03.480
Isn't it supposed to be 7 p.m.?

40:03.560 --> 40:05.640
Dr. Fang is a rigorous person.

40:05.720 --> 40:07.240
We can't be late.

40:07.320 --> 40:08.160
Where are you?

40:08.240 --> 40:10.600
I…

40:10.680 --> 40:11.840
I… I'm already here.

40:11.920 --> 40:14.040
I came with my sister.

40:14.120 --> 40:15.920
We had dinner with Fang Jin.

40:16.000 --> 40:17.760
Now we're talking to her.

40:17.840 --> 40:20.800
Please tell Dr. Fang I'm coming.

40:21.600 --> 40:22.960
Okay.

40:25.560 --> 40:27.400
- What should I do?
- Relax.

40:27.480 --> 40:29.440
You just need to play two roles.

40:29.520 --> 40:30.920
You're not new to this.

40:31.000 --> 40:33.240
With your acting skills,
you'll definitely make it.

40:33.840 --> 40:35.920
You're just bystanders.

40:52.840 --> 40:53.800
Hello, Dr. Tang.

40:53.880 --> 40:55.080
Hello, Dr. Fang.

40:56.080 --> 40:56.960
Long time no see.

40:57.040 --> 40:58.360
Let's get to the point.

40:58.440 --> 41:00.080
I'm Fang Jin's lawyer.

41:02.600 --> 41:03.960
Where's Chengcheng?

41:04.040 --> 41:06.360
She went to the restroom.

41:08.480 --> 41:11.080
Chengcheng has told me about your company.

41:11.160 --> 41:15.160
Thank you for not giving up
on Air Fiber Elastic Mesh.

41:16.040 --> 41:17.400
She also told me that

41:17.480 --> 41:19.560
you think highly of Air Fiber Elastic Mesh

41:20.160 --> 41:21.880
and want to cooperate with me.

41:22.760 --> 41:25.360
I didn't expect her to be so efficient.

41:26.320 --> 41:29.200
Dr. Tang, you should be glad
to have such a good employee.

41:29.280 --> 41:31.720
She's hard-working and kind.

41:32.520 --> 41:34.400
It doesn't matter. Let's get to the point.

41:35.400 --> 41:36.280
Okay.

41:36.360 --> 41:39.960
Actually, I'm here to discuss
Air Fiber Elastic Mesh with you.

41:40.600 --> 41:43.080
That's great.
I also want to discuss it with you.

41:44.080 --> 41:45.520
We thought about the same thing.

41:45.600 --> 41:46.600
This way.

41:51.440 --> 41:54.960
At this point, I have my own reasons
for not selling the patent

41:55.040 --> 41:57.560
of Air Fiber Elastic Mesh.

41:57.640 --> 41:58.960
Most importantly,

41:59.040 --> 42:02.240
I found that it has a flaw.

42:02.320 --> 42:03.920
Flaw?

42:04.520 --> 42:05.480
Look at this.

42:13.880 --> 42:16.440
Same ingredients, different storage times.

42:16.520 --> 42:17.360
Yes.

42:18.040 --> 42:19.320
No. 1 was just opened.

42:19.400 --> 42:20.440
No. 2, a month.

42:20.520 --> 42:21.920
No. 3, three months.

42:22.880 --> 42:24.280
When opened,

42:24.360 --> 42:26.320
the foundation effect is great.

42:26.400 --> 42:28.120
However, as time goes by,

42:28.200 --> 42:29.880
the liquid in the foundation will be lost.

42:30.680 --> 42:32.520
Even with the same foundation

42:32.600 --> 42:34.400
and fiber elastic mesh,

42:34.480 --> 42:37.320
it's hard to offset
the oxidation caused by time.

42:40.080 --> 42:43.200
We only considered the ideal situation.

42:43.280 --> 42:45.480
We pursue perfection,

42:45.560 --> 42:48.000
but we need to consider
the imperfections of reality.

42:48.080 --> 42:51.160
Both your foundation and my elastic mesh

42:51.240 --> 42:53.240
need improvements.

42:53.320 --> 42:54.680
I need more time.

42:56.520 --> 42:57.640
For customers,

42:57.720 --> 43:00.240
- there's no second best.
- There's no second best.

43:18.800 --> 43:20.440
Great minds think alike.

43:38.560 --> 43:40.760
What took Su Chengcheng so long?

43:44.880 --> 43:47.360
I need to give you something.
Wait a minute.

43:55.640 --> 43:57.480
Chengcheng, are you okay?

43:57.560 --> 43:59.920
I'm fine. I just had diarrhea.

44:00.000 --> 44:01.440
Fang Jin, are you okay?

44:01.520 --> 44:03.600
I'm okay. You can go.

44:03.680 --> 44:04.520
Okay.

44:11.640 --> 44:12.640
Mr. Tang.

44:14.880 --> 44:16.320
We ate the same take-out.

44:16.400 --> 44:17.640
Why did you have diarrhea?

44:20.840 --> 44:22.080
How should I know?

44:25.880 --> 44:28.840
You guys talk. I'll go to the restroom.

44:35.480 --> 44:36.560
Well…

44:39.640 --> 44:41.360
Mr. Tang, I'll get some water for you.

44:55.120 --> 44:57.680
Small gift.
Thank you for Guan Shengyu's matter.

44:59.520 --> 45:00.560
This…

45:05.800 --> 45:07.840
I collected fibers from all over the world

45:07.920 --> 45:08.960
for the research

45:09.040 --> 45:11.440
on Air Fiber Elastic Mesh.

45:11.520 --> 45:14.000
I think you might need this.

45:16.200 --> 45:18.120
I do. Thanks.

45:23.440 --> 45:24.800
Are you alright?

45:25.680 --> 45:26.920
Do you need to use the restroom?

45:27.720 --> 45:29.560
- I'm sorry.
- It's okay.

45:39.000 --> 45:41.600
Fang Jin, are you also having diarrhea?

45:42.200 --> 45:44.600
Can you walk Dr. Tang out?

45:44.680 --> 45:46.760
I'm sorry for the trouble.

45:47.440 --> 45:48.280
Okay.

45:57.440 --> 46:00.760
Mr. Tang. Fang Jin
can't come back for the moment.

46:00.840 --> 46:01.680
Now that…

46:01.760 --> 46:04.040
You've discussed it with her. Let's go.

46:04.120 --> 46:05.560
Okay.
